  "label": "The text 'prospective without white' maps to the visual scene of a person browsing clothing.",
  "description": "The phrase 'prospective without white' is overlaid on the image of a person browsing clothing racks. The mapping implies that the visual scene (the person browsing) represents or embodies the concept of 'prospective without white', suggesting that the act of browsing or selecting (a prospective action) is being framed as occurring without the presence or consideration of white perspectives or people. This is an analogical mapping where the visual material (the person browsing) is mapped onto the textual concept (prospective without white).",
